window.products.push({"id":276154,"name":"Queens of Christmas 10MM 18' Spool of Blue Ropelight 150' LED Rope Light","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zReZEv4XL._AC_.jpg","description":"This 18' spool of Blue rope light uses the latest generation LED bulbs, making it more energy efficient than ever before! This spool is an excellent decorative choice when adding a special lighting touch to your decor. It is a terrific alternative to neon tubing in night clubs, bars, and other places of business. Can be cut approximately every 36\" for a near custom length, with a maximum single run of 18'. Includes its own accessories for mounting (1-6ft SJTW Power Cord + TS-A6, 1 End Caps, 10 Mounting Caps, 20 Screws).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zReZEv4XL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Queens of Christmas","source_asin":"B00OS5O20W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-276154","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OS5O20W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OS5O20W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
