window.products.push({"id":276291,"name":"Biddeford Velour Sherpa Electric Heated Warming Blanket King Gray Washable Auto Shut Off 10 Heat Settings","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IctwjE6nL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Biddeford Blankets luxuriously soft Velour Sherpa electric heated warming blanket. This super soft, warm, velour blanket has an easy-to-use digital controller with 10 personal heat settings. Constructed with ultra-thin wires for added comfort. Should you get too cozy and nod off, don't worry - this blanket has a 10-hour auto shut-off timer to keep you safe and sound and also save energy. Machine wash and dry. Five year manufacturer's warranty.Twin Size (single controller) 62\" X 84\"Full Size (single controller) 72\" X 84\"Queen Size (Dual controllers) 84\" X 90\"King Size (Dual controllers) 100\" X 90\" *Note for Customers Outside of North America. These heated bedding products were made to work with 110V Electrical systems. If you live in a country that utilizes a different electrical system you may need to use a converter for these products to function. The act of using a converter automatically voids the warranty on these products. **All Biddeford Blankets are rigorously tested and approved by a third party (UL or ETK Intertek) to comply with current industry safety standards. Please reference the included use and safety instructions to insure safe operation. Additional safety certification for this product can be viewed on the UL or Intertek websites or by calling their perspective customer care phone numbers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IctwjE6nL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Biddeford Blankets","source_asin":"B07VB5R8G7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-276291","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VB5R8G7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VB5R8G7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":276292,"name":"PMMASTO Widen Tiered Spice Rack, Seasoning Organizer, Clear Acrylic Vertical Shelves Can OrganWizer for Countertop, Cabinet, Pantry, Kitchen Organizat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JcgZp3eLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STOP WASTING YOUR TIME TRYING TO LOOK FOR YOUR SPICES! PMMASTO tiered spice rack organizer can make better use of your precious kitchen cabinet or countertop space. Spice up your kitchen organization skills for easy meal prep and avoid the hassle of searching through cluttered cabinets for desired ingredients. ORGANIZATION AND STORAGE The space-saving finishing storage acrylic shelf is essential for any room that needs a little tidying up. Used in the kitchen to organize and store seasonings, salt and pepper grinders, jars, jams, canned food, etc.! It is versatile, you can display perfume and cosmetics on the dressing table, or display daily toiletries and medicines on the bathroom counter. The most important thing is to enjoy your neat and orderly space, forming a beautiful \"landscape\".The width of the spice rack has been increased to 2.87 inches to better accommodate larger spice bottles. CLEAR TIERED DESIGN √Space-saving solution with tiers step design. √Made of clear durable acrylic board and acrylic shelves. √Clean by hand. DO NOT place in dishwasher. INSTALLATION STEPS Take out all the materials in the acrylic spice rack package, including acrylic rack, acrylic plate, screwdriver and screw nails, prepare for installation.For layered operation, first take an acrylic stand and align it with the drilled hole on one side of the acrylic plate, then put in the screw and tighten it with a screwdriver.After that, take another acrylic board and align it with the drilled holes on the other side of the shelf, put in the screws and tighten it. Congratulations on the installation of the first layer.Then install the acrylic shelves in layers according to the previous method.Step by step, please pay attention to tighten the screws.The installation is complete, congratulations on getting the perfect layered vertical spice rack! THREE SPECIFICATIONS LET YOU CHOOSE 3 Tiers----12.21 x 9.29 x 3.85 inches 4 Tiers---- 12.21x 12.36x 5.11 inches 5 Tiers---- 12.21x 15.39x 6.45 inches Tips： The height of each tier of acrylic shelf is 1.22 inch . Multiple specifications and multiple choices, just to create better products for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JcgZp3eLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PMMASTO","source_asin":"B0BX9D7LXT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-276292","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BX9D7LXT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BX9D7LXT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
