window.products.push({"id":276328,"name":"BELLEMARK Floating Nightstand | Wall Mounted Wood Bedside Table and Shelf for Bedrooms Hanging Storage Stand Great for Living Rooms, Dining Rooms, and","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kzC4jeeRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BelleMark wood furniture is the perfect blend of aesthetics and rugged durability. A tasteful blending of rustic feel with a modern touch, this bed side masterpiece is bound to be the cherry on top in your bedrooms decorative theme. However, it’s not all about looks with BelleMark, it's also about a painstaking commitment to absolute quality. When it comes to buying the perfect bedroom accent, you deserve more than a product where cost savings were the main focus during manufacturing. While this solid pine wood masterpiece is great for the bedroom, its also a super useful crossover storage solution for other areas of your home as well such as your living or dining room – even your entryway! Whether you want to display your favorite decorative items – or stow essentials like electronics the BelleMark floating nightstand with drawer is perfect for all scenarios.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kzC4jeeRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BELLEMARK","source_asin":"B09KP71CS3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-276328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KP71CS3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KP71CS3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":276329,"name":"Mundial 5100 Series 2-Piece Carving Set, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51a6krJSy4L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com Although not as thin as the best carving blades, the long blade of this set's knife performs any slicing job, and the knife is just the right length for cooks with medium-size hands. Mundial's Forged line of knives ranks below its Le Cordon Bleu line in prestige, but the knife blades are virtually identical. (Both lines feature blades forged from single pieces of steel.) This knife handle is not as deeply rounded as those of some manufacturers and its bolster not as thick, resulting in a lighter handle and more weight-forward balance. The knife and fork will go through the dishwasher, but it's not recommended, because they might suffer nicks. Both have lifetime warranties against defects. This set is also available with hardwood handles . --Fred Brack From the Manufacturer A nice carving set makes a tough job much easier. This two-piece Mundial 5100 set includes an 8-inch carving knife that slices meat with ease, along with a 4-inch straight-tined fork that holds it in place. For many chefs, nothing beats the ergonomic comfort or classic styling of fully forged cutlery in \"basic black.\" Mundial's 5100 Series Black is just that. The company's oldest line of fully forged knives, it exemplifies all the expertise that Mundial has acquired through its more than 70 years of crafting gourmet cutlery. 5100 Series Black is fully forged from high-carbon stainless steel and features a durable polyacetal handle in the traditional three-rivet style. The value of a fully forged knife Mundial knives, with very few exceptions, are fully forged in a manufacturing process that combines innovative technology with old-world tradition and expertise. In the forging process, steel is heated to an extremely high temperature, set into a die, and hammered into the shape of the basic blade. Following a heating and cooling process, the forged blade is ground to create a full taper to the cutting edge. The result is a stronger, thicker, more resilient blade that flares smoothly at the heel to blend into the shape of the handle. Fully forged cutlery offers an array of key benefits, including greater tensile strength, increased durability, lasting sharpness, and better balance and control. Construction Mundial's computer-aided design creates the perfect shape and balance for chopping, dicing, and slicing all types of food. The knives are fully forged from high-carbon chrome molybdenum stainless steel for the best edge retention and sharpening ease. Each knife also undergoes Mundial's computerized blade grinding and polishing process to create a precise taper from tip to bolster (the quality bolster is the main feature of any truly forged knife). Busy chefs will appreciate the ergonomically crafted handles with full tangs, which deliver comfort, balance, and durability. Every Mundial knife is also hand sharpened and individually tested for ultimate performance. Quality Control How do Mundial knives compare to other premium cutlery? In addition to its extensive quality control procedures, Mundial regularly submits its products to an international independent testing facility. These standardized testing methodologies continue to show that Mundial knives are among the best in the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51a6krJSy4L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mundial","source_asin":"B00004RBSH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-276329","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004RBSH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004RBSH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
