window.products.push({"id":276367,"name":"Mini Ash Bucket with Lid,Shovel & Hand Broom,Galvanized Steel Metal Charcoal Container, Coal Bucket with Handle,Tool Set Accessories for Fireplace Ind","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ez-nrqijL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH QUALITY MATERIALS：The ash bucket is made of high quality galvanized steel and powder,it's able to withstand high temperatures. The ash bucket with a golden edge near bottom. (Warm tips：Best placed on fireplace, stone, slate, or brick).It will keep your ground safe and undamaged. It will be at your service for a very long time. EXTRA TOOLS-WITH SHOVEL & HANDROOM BRUSH: The ash bucket set treats you with a wooden handle shovel and broom. The shovel and broom all have a wooden handle that won't transfer heat like metal. The surface of our shovel has a slope, which makes the shovel easier. The brush's bristles are very dense, so it makes hearth cleaner. And brush bristles are durable PP plastic, which is great for sweeping up tiny particles like dust, sand and dirt. Shovel - 14.96\"*4.13\", Bamboo Brush- 8.7\"*3\". SAFE TO CARRY & KEEP YOUR FIREPLACE CLEAN: A flexible wooden handle can easily lift the bucket.It can protect the hand from burns. The ash bucket with lid keeps the ashes inside all the time until you can dispose of them. It's a good choice to keep your fireplace tidy. MINI ASH BUCKET：Measured bucket 9.05\"(L) x 6.29\"(W) x 8.66\"(H), PACKAGE- Including 1 x bucket with lid, 1 x shovel, 1 x broom. The 1.42 gallon（5.35 L） capacity can easily store or transfer wood ashes. Suitable for a fire pit, fireplace, wood burner. Of course, it can also be used for the transfer and removal of burning charcoal when grilling. SAFE FOR INDOOR AND OUTDOOR USE – Perfect for fireplaces, fire pits, pizza ovens, grills, and more. Use it to safely clean up ash, coals and embers or to store kindling wood, coal, or other fireplace items. It is not only a fireplace tool, but also a good fireplace decoration.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ez-nrqijL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"G GOOD GAIN","source_asin":"B0BLMHQQZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-276367","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLMHQQZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLMHQQZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
