window.products.push({"id":276529,"name":"Hallmark Ornament 2020 Year-Dated, Premium Baby's First Christmas Silver Baby Rattle with Blue Ribbon, Metal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71djrIlUqEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Everything \"Christmas\" is such a delight when seen through a new baby's eyes. Parents and grandparents will love this premium silver-tone metal rattle Christmas tree ornament. Elegant filigree design is accentuated with a blue ribbon bow to commemorate a precious little one's first Christmas. Year dated 2020. Made of metal, this Hallmark Ornament measures 2 x 4 x 2 inches. The ornament is ready to hang on your Christmas tree with a hanger attachment. Great Christmas gift idea for new parents and grandparents. Hallmark Ornaments are a great way to commemorate hobbies, life events and individual interests. Each festive and collectible ornament is perfect for sharing with family and friends. Hallmark has been your family-owned creator of greeting cards, Christmas tree ornaments, gifts, gift wrap and more for over 100 years. We take deep pride in helping individuals connect in just the right way.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71djrIlUqEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hallmark","source_asin":"B084HFRXDM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-276529","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084HFRXDM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084HFRXDM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":276530,"name":"Cordless Vacuum Cleaner 30000pa Powerful Suction,60mins Runtime,Stick Vacuum Cleaner with LED Display,5-Stage HEPA Filter,Rotatable Brush with LED Fro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":239.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618Twe7JTqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【30000Pa POWERFUL SUCTION】 The OSOTEK Cordless vacuum cleaner comes equipped with a 320W Dual Digital brushless motor. This motor produces less noise, has a longer lifetime, and has three power modes, the highest of which has a suction power of up to 30000Pa. This powerful, high-performance machine eliminates dirt, debris, pet hair, and tough messes. It performs well on multiple floor surfaces such as hardwood, tile, and low rug. ✅【60min LONG-LASTING BATTERY & 3 SUCTION MODES】 The cordless vacuum cleaner is powered by a 7*2500mAh lithium battery, which provides up to 60 minutes of consistent power in the low mode. The vacuum has three power modes (ECO mode [60 min runtime], Standard mode [25 min runtime], and Turbo mode [10 min runtime]. The three power modes enable the vacuum can clean different floors with minimum power consumption. ✅【5-LAYER EFFICIENCY FILTRATION SYSTEM】 The vacuum boasts a high-efficiency, 5-stage, fully sealed cyclone filtration system. The system captures 99.9% of fine dust and creates a powerful centrifugal force to help filter particles as small as 0.3 microns. This technology enables the filter to release clean, fresh air. The filter is also both detachable and washable. A clean filter can prevent blockages, reduce suction loss, and maintain steady suction power. ✅【180° LAY COMPLETELY FLAT 】 The cordless vacuum cleaner's brush head can lay completely flat,which is perfect for a home with small nooks and crannies. It can thoroughly clean hard-to-reach spaces such as tight edges, below furniture, and sharp corners. The brush head also has bright LED lights on the front to light up dimly-lit corners and dark spaces below various pieces of furniture. ✅【PORTABLE HANDHELD VACUUM CLEANER】 The vacuum cleaner can convert into a lightweight, portable handheld vacuum that can be carried around easily to spot-clean the most hard-to-reach areas. These areas include but are not limited to corners, window track, above shelves, etc. The vacuum comes with a power brush, a mini electronic brush, a 2-in-1 dusting brush, and a crevice tool for versatile cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618Twe7JTqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OSOTEK","source_asin":"B0BBGCSYH5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-276530","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBGCSYH5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBGCSYH5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
