window.products.push({"id":276572,"name":"Yankee Candle Small Jar Candle, Sugared Apple","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41GUXwRLx4L.jpg","description":"A deliciously sweet apple treat... a perfect recipe of juicy apples sprinkled with sugar and vanilla. The traditional design of our Signature classic jar candle reflects a warm, relaxed sense of style that's always at home. Convenient and easy to use, our small jar candle provides 25 to 40 hours of true fragrance enjoyment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41GUXwRLx4L.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yankee Candle","source_asin":"B00UBV4E3W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-276572","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00UBV4E3W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00UBV4E3W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":276573,"name":"Global Furniture Rogers Collection Bonded Leather Matching Love , Cappuccino with Chrome Legs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j0WaUKcLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Don't snooze on style for your home - go with the Rogers Collection for cutting-edge furniture that doesn't slouch on comfort. Dazzle your family and friends with the top-grain leather, contemporary style, and plush seating. Needless to say, this love seat is an exceptional piece on its own, but it also perfectly suits the matching sofa and chairs from the Rogers Collection. Every piece in this collection is available for sale on Amazon -- as are other Global Furniture collections, styles, and colors -- so you can mix and match and experiment with different combinations to create your perfect living room, great room, or rec room setting, all from the comfort of your home! This Global Furniture USA Love seat has been modeled to cater to both the desires of the contemporary or transitional home for design and comfort. The contemporary style makes it a great match for most any decor or setting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j0WaUKcLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Global Furniture USA","source_asin":"B007HLZL5Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-276573","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007HLZL5Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007HLZL5Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":276574,"name":"Houston Texas Skyline Blue by Michael Tompsett, 12x19-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.26,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-n4jAwrAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a watercolor skyline of Houston, Texas. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies. After 12 years Michael Tompsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Although Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, his main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Tompsett creates urban landmark and cityscape designs. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-n4jAwrAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B01MQYG6A6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-276574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MQYG6A6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MQYG6A6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":276575,"name":"Silicone Popsicle Molds, 6-Cavities Frozen Ice Pop Molds with Reusable Sticks, Popsicle Holder for Kids, Ice Pop Maker with Silicone Funnel and Brush","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51x3tPy3C+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Why Choice Our Ice Pop Molds: - You'll feel great for giving your kids an frozen treat for lunch, dessert or an after-school snack! - Made of high quality food grade silicone.You can use our ice pop maker make healthy ice Popsicle. - You can make healthy, low sugar snacks that easily store in the freezer until used. - Reusable, No waste. - Wonderful Tools: These popsicle molds comes with a free folding funnel to avoid the mess and a special brush to wash the product perfectly. NOTE： The slots in the stick create freezing within the stick allowing for easier removal of the popsicle from its mold. The lids do NOT snap on. Just press the lid gently onto the mold. Freeze for about 4 hours and then run warm water over the frozen mold for about 30 seconds to easily remove your popsicle from the mold. Package include: 1*Ice Pop Molds with 6-Cavities ,6-Ice Sticks. 1*Silicone Collapsible Funnel. 1*Clean Brush. Also Cool off Your Pup with Frozen Treats! Don't you love to have healthy snacks for your favorite \"best friend\"? What could be better than popsicles on a hot summer day!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51x3tPy3C+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SITREMEN","source_asin":"B0897PVNY9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-276575","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0897PVNY9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0897PVNY9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
