window.products.push({"id":276630,"name":"SHI BA ZI ZUO Pro Versatile Hone Manual Knife Sharpener Extremely Fast Sharpening Euro-American and Asian Style Knives Precise Bevel Angle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oycOZxqVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【VERSATILE SHARPENING TOOL】- SHI BA ZI ZUO SM-19 knife sharpener is available to grind stainless steel knife, ceramic knife and shears. Comparing to other sharpeners, the feature of this sharpener is that it can be used to hone shears, except for knife blades. 【EASY TO USE】- Place a dull blade edge knife on the sharpener with the edge touching the grinding angle. Drag and push the blade back and forth though the grinding angle several times. Then the knife edge gets sharp again. It is easy to handle and time saving. It is a perfect knife assistance in kitchens. 【ERGONOMIC DESIGN】- This sharpener is suitable for both left-handed and right-handed users. Wave design handle enables fingers to shape around the handle for secure grip. Non-slip rubber on the bottom enhances the friction against table for stability and safety. 【DURABLE AND STRONG】- The sharpener is made from high quality ABS material for excellent industrial strength and stability that will last for long time. Each sharpener is precise polish producing a sleek and gripping surface. It is a perfect choice keeping your knife sharp. 【PRODUCT GUARANTEE】- SHI BA ZI ZUO is 100% quality guarantee for its products. Customers enjoy fully refund and money back warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oycOZxqVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SHI BA ZI ZUO","source_asin":"B07WDWMY6X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-276630","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WDWMY6X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WDWMY6X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":276631,"name":"Ballucci Criss Cross Floating Wall Shelf, Set of 2, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618+x+-vMoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For an always unique display These criss cross floating wall shelves were created with an impactful design that is a great addition to any wall. These shelves will help you utilize your wall efficiently, keep your daily items always well-organized and decorated. Each shelf attaches to the wall with two keyhole perforations in the back, which secure to nails or screws showing no visible hardware. Ideal for picture frames and light items. Multifunctional appearance to fit different scenarios Clean and minimalistic in look, will display small items, photo frames and collectibles. Create a lasting effect in any living room or office space with this unique design. High quality construction with beautiful furniture grade finish, these shelves will go great in your bedroom and even for the bathroom. Because of its coated finish, it easily combines with most decors. Assembly and maintenance This easy to hang shelf comes with hanging hardware and requires minimal assembly. Includes step by step instructions for easy installation. When dirty, wipe it clean with a soft damp cloth and wipe dry with a clean cloth. Please note: all dimensions are manually measured with a possible deviation. Product specifications Material: Durable MDF – Not laminated Color: White Overall Dimensions: 17x5x17\" (LxWxH) Maximum weight capacity: 10 lb per shelf Package content 2 x 17x5x17\" shelves 4 x wall screws 4 x plastic wall anchors 8 x assembly screws 1 x installation instructions Important Due to monitor variations colors may appear slightly different.  Shelves are HAND-MADE, if there is a scratch or tiny flaw, please contact us, we will response within 24 hours. We guarantee you'll be happy or we guarantee your money back!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618+x+-vMoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ballucci","source_asin":"B077RPTX9Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-276631","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077RPTX9Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077RPTX9Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":276632,"name":"Lolita Birthday Wine Glasses with Bottle Opener (Tipsy Birthday)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41PgEcKRElL._AC_.jpg","description":"Lolita's Story:It all started with a girls’ night out… one that contained more than the usual laughter and fun. Browsing for the first time through a Martini menu, Lolita was inspired by the recipes. After being served a Cosmopolitan, her creative imagination made her see the glass differently – the way she thought it should be – a bit more dressed up with a pattern, with flair and a fabulous recipe on the bottom. After seeing each of her friends pick a different martini, reflective of their distinct personalities, the foundation for a product line was created.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41PgEcKRElL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Enesco","source_asin":"B01M8LQXEW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-276632","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M8LQXEW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M8LQXEW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
