window.products.push({"id":276634,"name":"ALFA Furnishing Drafting Chair, Ergonomic Standing Desk Tall Office Stool with Adjustable Height Back Support and Foot Ring for Computer, Studio, Work","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-s-nraB3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【LARGE and TALL ADJUSTABLE ERGONOMIC CHAIR】- The Ergonomic desk chair is authorized by BIFMA Standards and Greenguard, which is Environmental-friends. It has multiple functions, which meet different needs. It’s essential to choose a safe, ergonomic chair that reduces back and neck pain. An ergonomically agreeable chair and work environment can also improve our health. 【LUMBAR SUPPORT】- The height of the backrest could be adjusted from 26.57\"-29.72\" freely by merely pulling it up with two hands. And it will be returned to the smallest size automatically when it's pulled to the top; The tilt function with position lock and 140 ° back adjustment is perfect for your office rest. 【ADJUSTABLE ARMRESTS & SEAT CUSHION】3D Adjustable Armrests go forwards, back, up, down, side to side. The 3.15\" adjustment of seat depth provides a comfortable sitting experience for users with various heights and weights. The lumbar support offers excellent support for users with a height of 4.92\" to 6.56\". It can carry a weight of up to 300lbs 【COMFY EXPERIENCE】- This executive chair adopts a premium molded foam, which offers you 360-degree excellent support while leaning back or sitting. The designer carefully designed the seat cushion angle with a higher front to minimize the legs' pressure distribution. Once you sit on this chair, you could immediately feel the difference. 【EASILY INSTALLED】Our ergonomic desk chair with 360° wheels comes with all the hardware and necessary tools. It can easily be installed and ready to use in about 10-15 minutes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-s-nraB3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALFA FURNISHING","source_asin":"B08HCZWRG3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-276634","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HCZWRG3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HCZWRG3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
