window.products.push({"id":276638,"name":"ANTEN 36x28 Inch Backlit Bathroom Vanity Mirror with Lights, 3000-6000K Dimmable LED Bathroom Mirror, Anti-Fog Wall-Mounted Lighted Bathroom Mirror, T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710r2z5hSnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Adjustable Color & Brightness: With stepless adjustable color and brightness settings, our LED vanity mirror offers customized lighting to suit your specific needs. You can easily adjust the color temperatures from warm to natural to white, and each color temperature comes with stepless dimming. The smart memory function records your previous lighting setting, making it easy to pick up where you left off. Shatterproof & Rustproof: Looking for a vanity mirror that combines style and durability? Look no further than the ANTEN Shatterproof LED Vanity Mirror. Made from 5mm HD environmentally friendly copper-free silver mirror, this mirror not only has a classic design that never goes out of style, but its quality can also stand the test of time. The shatterproof feature ensures that even if the mirror is broken, it won't shatter into pieces, providing a safer user experience. Waterproof & Anti Fog Mirror: IP54 rated waterproof ensures safe lighting in wet bathroom environments. Anti-fog function easily “de-steam” the vanity mirror after you get out of the shower. The backlit mirror incorporates LED lights and a defogger to give users a clear and bright image. (The anti-fog function will turn off automatically after an hour.) Wall-Mounted Lighted Mirror: The lighted bathroom mirrors for wall can be mounted horizontally or vertically according to your room's space, and locating the installation punch point is made easy through the specially designed position card. It can be powered by plug or hardwired. If you want to hardwired it, it's suggested by a professional electrician. Improved Package & Warranty: Our lighted led mirror is secured with customized thick foam box, and pass multiple tests including dropping test, impact test, which significantly reduce damage during transportation. We're confident in our product, and all ANTEN mirrors come with a 3-year warranty. Please contact us for any questions or concerns. Tips: If you want to turn off the blue lights of the controls, simply double-click the button after turning off the mirror light.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710r2z5hSnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"A ANTEN","source_asin":"B08L6F9QPV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-276638","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L6F9QPV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L6F9QPV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
