window.products.push({"id":276790,"name":"Compost Bin, 1.3 Gal Kitchen Compost Bin Countertop with Lid - Small Indoor Compost Bucket with 7 Bonus Charcoal Filters, Flies/Odor Proof Compost Con","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6180Koz5hJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FARMHOUSE STYLE COMPOSTING BIN: Bored of using old style kitchen garbage bins with stubborn appearance, releases odors, and attracts fruit flies? You got it here! This indoor compost bin will just do the job you need and meanwhile add a totally fresh feel to your kitchen. The vintage farmhouse style print compost bucket will surely make your kitchen more attractive than ever. GORGEOUS DESIGN AND PERFECT SIZE: Beside the vitage off-white painting, this compost container is made in perfect size(9\"H*9\"W, 1.3-Gallon) which is large enough to keep kitchen scraps for at least 3 days for a family of 4 and meanwhile small enough to be put anywhere in kitchen-countertop corner, beside sink, under cabinet, just as you like. STURDY WITH LIGHT WEIGHT: Made of carbon steel body, this recycling bin is sturdy enough work for ages, but meanwhile it it not heavy, which makes transporting scraps compost from kitchen to outside composting bin very easy and convenient. The light lid fits snug but loose enough for you to remove with just a few fingers while your hand is full of fruit scraps, which is just perfect for daily use. Interior coating prevents corrosion and is easy to clean with kitchen detergent. KEEP KITCHEN ENVIRONMENT IN GOOD: Having this functional kitchen compost keeper, you no longer need to pour garbage every day to prevent smells. The large capacity compost pail collects and holds daily scraps trash securely(primarily fruit, veg, egg shells, coffee grounds and shredded paper), the lid fits bucket body tightly and tight-fitting charcoal filter will decompose food or fruit smell without releasing any odors outside. Artketty struggles to make life nicer and more comfortable, your satisfaction always means everything to us. So, in case you are not 100% satisfied with this kitchen compost bucket, do not hesitate to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6180Koz5hJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARTKETTY","source_asin":"B086KYXGHG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-276790","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086KYXGHG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086KYXGHG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
