window.products.push({"id":276864,"name":"Comfy Sacks Memory Foam Bean Bag Chair, White Furry","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":385.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tph5gXqCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One of best sellers is the 6ft Comfy Sack simply because of it's size. The size of this chair offer two things that many people seek which is the ability to seat two large adults while simultaneously not taking up as much space. It is a superb replacement to the love seat. Many people also choose our 6ft sack instead of recliners for the theatre rooms or basements since it's splendid for long hours of sitting. So whether your caught up in a latest video game or in the mood for a series marathon, you'll be constantly cozy. Soon enough, one won't simply be enough for you and your family as everyone will be rushing towards it!.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tph5gXqCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Comfy Sacks","source_asin":"B095XGP7JR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-276864","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095XGP7JR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095XGP7JR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
