window.products.push({"id":276899,"name":"The Ibis Print Gallery - Frederick Catherwood : ''Castle at Tuloom (Plate 23)'' (Views of Ancient Monuments in Central America, Chiapas and Yucatan, 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kz3xhklKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The 1839 and 1841 expeditions of Frederick Catherwood and John Lloyd Stephens sparked early popular interest in the Maya civilization, which had been largely undocumented at the time. As Stephens published popular accounts of their travels, Catherwood, an artist and architect, made sepia drawings of the sites they visited. Aided by a camera lucida, he was able to render the ruined architecture — intricately graven with strange and unfamiliar glyphs — with such precision that later archaeologists were able to decipher the inscriptions. Twenty-five of these images, garnished with romantic landscapes beset by overgrown vegetation, were published as lithographs in the exquisite folio volume Views of Ancient Monuments in Central America, Chiapas and Yucatan (1844), limited to 300 copies. \"In the whole range of literature on the Maya,\" writes David Drew, in his Lost Chronicles of the Maya, \"there has never appeared a more magnificent work.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kz3xhklKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Ibis","source_asin":"B07TJDQJYH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-276899","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TJDQJYH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TJDQJYH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
